  "recipe": {
    "hash": "hashSeed is FNV-1a over the UTF-16 code units of generatorVersion, a NUL, and the seed, using Math.imul wrapping uint32 arithmetic.",
    "prng": "mulberry32(hash) is sampled twice from a fresh stream: four unit-interval draws stored as big-endian IEEE-754 float64 hex, then four nextInt(rng, 10) results from another fresh stream.",
    "streams": "eventStreamKey and deriveEventSeed use simulation version 1. Logical keys are the empty list and matchday:1. No database ids or clock time are included.",
    "fingerprints": "careerFingerprint is the JSON array standalone-career, generator 2, name, seed, start year, club key, rules mode, and preset.",
    "dates": "seasonDates, addDays, transferWindowOn, ageInWholeYears, and previewTimeAdvance are called with the fixed inputs below. No ambient clock is read.",
    "money": "parseMoneyCents and formatMoneyEuros use the existing euro parser. Amounts stay in integer cents.",
    "policy": "evaluateAction uses the balanced and strict constitution presets. Reports are the full verdict objects."
  },
